.TH ADU_STATUS_CLI 1 "2024-01-01" "ADU Agent 2.0.0" "ADU Agent Manual"
.SH NAME
adu_status_cli \- display the status of the Azure Device Update agent
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B adu_status_cli
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B adu_status_cli
queries the running ADU agent and displays its current status, including
the active deployment state, installed update version, and extension
information.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Display usage information and exit.
.TP
.B \-j, \-\-json
Output status in JSON format.
.TP
.B \-v, \-\-verbose
Enable verbose output with additional detail.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/adu/agent.toml
Agent configuration file.
.TP
.I /var/lib/adu/
Agent state directory.
.TP
.I /var/log/adu/
Agent log directory.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR adu_rc_decoder (1)
